# {{name}}: notes for coding agents

A Roblox game in Luau built on Hydrogen (systems, an app that boots them, a typed network). Rojo syncs `src/` into Studio, pesde installs packages, Rokit pins the tools.

Hydrogen's goals apply to every change here: developer experience (code that is easy to read and hard to misuse), reliability (validated payloads, explicit lifecycles, tests), performance (no work in hot paths that isn't needed).

## Read before writing Hydrogen code

Hydrogen's docs ship inside the installed package, matching the installed version. They exist after `pesde install`:

- `roblox_packages/.pesde/atk422+hydrogen/*/hydrogen/llms.txt`: index of the AI docs
- `roblox_packages/.pesde/atk422+hydrogen/*/hydrogen/docs/ai/*.md`: the AI docs
- `roblox_packages/.pesde/atk422+hydrogen/*/hydrogen/README.md`: the full reference (use it if the two above aren't there)

The `*` is the installed version (see `pesde.lock`). Don't guess the API from other frameworks.

## Layout

| Path | In Roblox | What goes there |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `src/server/Systems/` | `ServerScriptService.Server.Systems` | server systems, one per ModuleScript |
| `src/client/Systems/` | `StarterPlayer.StarterPlayerScripts.Client.Systems` | client systems |
| `src/shared/Network/` | `ReplicatedStorage.Shared.Network` | network definitions, required by both sides |
| `src/shared/` | `ReplicatedStorage.Shared` | other shared modules |
{{#if examples}}
| `src/server/Main.server.luau`, `src/client/Main.client.luau` | | boot the app; they pick up new systems and network modules by themselves |
{{/if}}
{{#unless examples}}
| `src/server/Main.server.luau`, `src/client/Main.client.luau` | | boot the app; they pick up new systems by themselves. Before the first network module, uncomment `app:addNetwork(...)` in both |
{{/unless}}
| `test/*.test.luau` | | tests, run by `test/run.luau` |
| `roblox_packages/`, `luau_packages/`, `lune_packages/` | `ReplicatedStorage.roblox_packages` | installed by pesde; never edit or commit |

## Commands

| Task | Command |
| --- | --- |
| Install tools, then packages | `rokit install` then `pesde install` |
| Build a place | `rojo build default.project.json --output build.rbxl` |
| Sync into Studio | `rojo serve` |
| Sourcemap (for luau-lsp) | `rojo sourcemap default.project.json --output sourcemap.json` |
| Test | `pesde run test` (exit code 1 on failure) |
{{#if selene}}
| Lint | `selene src test` |
{{/if}}
{{#if stylua}}
| Format / check formatting | `stylua src test` / `stylua --check src test` |
{{/if}}
{{#if luau_lsp}}
| Type check | `luau-lsp analyze --platform=roblox --sourcemap=sourcemap.json --definitions=@roblox=globalTypes.d.luau --ignore="**/roblox_packages/**" --ignore="**/luau_packages/**" src test` (download `globalTypes.d.luau` first, as in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`{{#unless ci}}, or from https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JohnnyMorganz/luau-lsp/{{luau_lsp_version}}/scripts/globalTypes.d.luau{{/unless}}) |
{{/if}}
| Add a package | `pesde add <scope/name>` then `pesde install` |

Before finishing a change, run the tests{{#if lint}} and the checks in the table above{{/if}}.

## Conventions

- Strict mode everywhere (`.luaurc` sets `languageMode: strict`). Keep the type checker clean.
- Require Hydrogen as `require(ReplicatedStorage.roblox_packages.hydrogen)`, with `local ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage")`.
- One system per ModuleScript: the module returns `Hydrogen.define(function(use) ... end)` at top level. The system's id is the module's name. Call `use(require(path.To.Other))` synchronously in the constructor to depend on another system; both must be in the same app.
- Hooks are optional methods: `init`, `start`, `playerAdded`, `playerRemoving`, `stop`. Don't use other systems' runtime state in `init`. Player hooks run in dependency order (`playerRemoving` in reverse).
- Network objects (`Hydrogen.clientEvent`, `serverEvent`, `clientFunction`, `serverFunction`) live in `src/shared/Network/` with a GreenTea schema (`Hydrogen.gt`). Both Main scripts register that folder with `app:addNetwork`, before `app:start()`. Names must be unique and the same on both sides. Never create network objects after `app:start()`.
- Call functions (`clientFunction:Fire`, `serverFunction:Fire`) from `start` or later, never from `init`.
- On the client, `WaitForChild` anything outside the script's own folder before using it.
- Tests require game code through the DataModel, like game code: `require(game:GetService("ServerScriptService").Server.Systems.Name)`. Use `Hydrogen.loopback()` for players and the network, `app:replace(System, fake)` for fakes, and stop every app and close every loopback in `test.on_test_leave`.
- Commit `pesde.lock`. Don't commit `sourcemap.json` or build outputs.
